# Evidence Visibility Directive

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-evidence-visibility-directive.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-evidence-visibility-directive.md)

## Rule

Evidence visibility increases with the **consequence of understanding**, not data volume.

Do **not** ship evidence as a UI block everywhere. Attach evidence to understanding; UI reveals by maturity.

## Ladder

| Level | Show | Answers |
|-------|------|---------|
| 1 Capture | Source + what recorded (minimal); why-asks optional/quiet | Where did this come from? |
| 2 Related | Light dated supporting observations | What contributed? |
| 3 Pattern | Moderate evidence + unknowns; no diagnosis | Why meaningful? |
| 5 Decision | High — source, date, context, reason/outcome when held; unknown reason OK | Why was this taken? |
| 10 Major change | Full evolution timeline + uncertainty; Person spine not Documents→Summaries | How did we get here? |

## Feel

*"SolenOS remembers why it thinks this."* — never *"showing me everything it processed."*

CRS stores understanding + supporting_evidence + uncertainty; Decision Memory (`src/lib/decision-memory`) holds why paths existed. Panel discloses by level. No confidence %, graphs, or engine jargon.
